  m_Text: 'Fixes and Updates:


    Graphics improvement;

    Lights improvements;

    Phone
    elements and visual;

    Overall game performance;

    New cursor added;

    Doors
    improvements;

    Fixed flashlight turn-on;


    Additions:

    Four new apps
    in the Phone;

    Dialogues in the Phone;

    Random flashlight blackout;

    In-game
    update screen;


    If you enjoy the experience consider making a donation to
    our Ko-fi and help us improve the game even more.


    Next update release:
    03/11


    - Skyward Games'
